==[[Range/Lore|The Range's lore assets]]==
===[[Range/Lore/EP4|Episode 4]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone7.mp3}} "I've been keeping an eye on [[Chamber]] for you. He's playing games but nothing you need to be concerned about... for now, at least. I know you don't trust him but we don't have that luxury. Chamber's made himself necessary and we need to accept that. And he's followed through so far, as long as he keeps delivering it's worth the risk. Our team will never be perfect. If it were, you'd only have [[Sova]] and [[Sage]] on the payroll. Hell, you made it work with [[Breach]]. I don't know how, but you did. If you can handle him, you can handle Chamber. I'll keep watching. The second his goals contradict ours... I'll take care of it"
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone14.mp3}} "[[Brimstone|Brim]], we can't pull this off any longer. We need more scouts. You have to stop relying on [[Sova]]. I know you trust him, he's capable, but he's one man and he's exhausted. Not that he admits it, heaven forbid your golden boy ever let you down... [[Cypher]]'s network is invaluable but it's a crutch. It doesn't replace our need for agents in the field. We're losing, Brim. You know that, right? If we're going to survive we need more information. We need more eyes."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone21.mp3}} "Brim, I need you to increase [[Reyna]]'s mission assignments. She has to collect more souls. We're already pushing the boundaries of the equipment but I need more. It's the transfer process, I'm losing too much in the conversion, for every unit infused another two are lost... life energy isn't exactly my area of expertise. I know this has... dragged on. I thought I'd have a... solution by now, a way to stabilize the chemical-radian equilibrium but... but we owe it to Reyna. Collecting enough life for the both of them... it can't be easy. As long as the child lives I have to keep trying. Because if we fail... I don't know what Reyna will do."

===[[Range/Lore/EP8|Episode 8]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone71.mp3}} "Liam, we need to talk. When [[Omen]] didn't know about his past, he was contained, a known entity. We kept him in the dark to protect both him and us. I had to lie to him. He-... he tried to kill me! Now, he's starting to piece things together and I—... I can't anticipate his actions now! Will he retaliate? Maybe leave the [[VALORANT Protocol|Protocol]], there are too many variables out of my control-... Keep an eye on him."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone83.mp3}} "Follow me here, I'm working a problem, just wanted a sounding board but your voicemail will do. [[Hourglass]] tried to kill me. Why? Logically there's only one answer: my research, they wanted to prevent humanity from discovering [[radianite]]. So they send [[Omen]] to kill me, he fails, [[First Light]] happens, and... everything changes. That all tracks, Hourglass has failed, but!... they keep working. They send operatives around the world to recover radianite artifacts. Why? What are they still hiding? There must be something, Brimstone, there has to be more, for Omen's sake, for mine... ugh, call me back."

===[[Range/Lore/V26|Season 2026]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone121.mp3}} "Liam, your question earlier... the one I dodged. You deserve an answer. Of course I've thought about it. You're an idiot sometimes. That bleeding heart of yours is going to get more than just you killed. At some point, you'll stand in the way of a needed sacrifice and I will act. But despite the appearance of present circumstances, it's not today. There's no plot to overthrow you, old friend. You've nothing to fear from me."
*{{AC|file=LegionAudioTap1.mp3}} "...All of you listen up. You want clarity? Here it is. [[Omega Brimstone|Brimstone]] is out. I am in command. I understand this makes some of you uncomfortable, you're fond of the old man. But before you scream "betrayal", answer me this: What is our purpose? [[Legion]], why are we here? To be soldiers? Symbols? No. Our purpose is to end the Alpha threat, not fight them, end them. [[Alpha Earth]] is killing us. And what have we, the beloved and celebrated VALORANT Legion done about it? Nothing. Less than nothing. Our [[spike]] extractions have plummeted. We were miles ahead technologically, now those miscreants invade our world. We've grown so incompetent even [[Atlas]] tries to do our job. You think this is about loyalty to Brimstone? No. This is about doing what is necessary. [[Omega Sova|Sova]] sees what I see. You doubt my intentions, do you doubt his? And [[Omega Yoru|Yoru]]? And [[Omega Breach|Breach]]? Have you all forgotten [[Omega Sage|Sage]], soaking in a chem-bath right now just to keep herself alive! We're done shedding tears for a leader who could not do his job. We are done doing things his way. No more rules, no more fighting fair. The only thing that matters is finishing this. We will cross the line, pursue their pain, and break them by any means necessary. You have your orders. Go."
*{{AC|file=LegionAudioTap2.mp3}} ''(For the entire transcription amongst the agents, see [[Range/Lore/V26#Cypher's Office 5|Range/Lore/V26 → v12.04 → Cypher's Office]].)''
*{{AC|file=LegionAudioTap3.mp3}} ''(For the entire transcription amongst the agents, see [[Range/Lore/V26#Cypher's Office 6|Range/Lore/V26 → v12.05 → Cypher's Office]].)''
*{{AC|file=LegionAudioTap5.mp3}} "Agents of Legion. I am pleased to report that our attacks are yielding the desired results. The pressure on α-[[Sage]] is unprecedented, her crystallization is rapidly advancing. You've given her a taste of what she's put us through. But we won't stop, not until we put her down! Destroy their capacity to revive and we destroy their capacity to resist, ending the Alpha threat. That is the goal, and you are doing it. Stay the course."
*{{AC|file=LegionAudioTap6.mp3}} ''(For the entire transcription amongst the agents, see [[Range/Lore/V26#Cypher's Office 9|Range/Lore/V26 → v12.08 → Cypher's Office]].)''
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone131.mp3}} "Liam, I want out of these meetings. You need the team to hear these recordings, fine, but I am done sitting there like... some specimen to dissect for everyone's entertainment! Listening to [[Omega Viper|her]]-... to me, I-... I don't need this mirror shoved in my face!"
*{{AC|file=LegionAudioTap10.mp3}} "<!--...they won't be the issue, look to your own [...]-->...the gully's a kill box and our [[Sage|target]] can't leave, not without answers to her problem that I know she won't find. You think I didn't check? That I didn't scour our own mountains a second time once again searching for a miracle before dumping [[Omega Sage|Sage]] in a vat?! That's twice those peaks have failed me! Their power, the [[Summit|academy]], it means nothing. Our Sage will recover through the treatment I am providing and her misprint will die chasing pure delusion. So while the target wastes her time meditating, we set the trap. Don't argue or judge me!"
*{{AC|file=LegionAudioTap14.mp3}} ''(For the entire transcription amongst the agents, see [[Range/Lore/V26#Cypher's Office 17|Range/Lore/V26 → v13.05 → Cypher's Office]].)''
*{{AC|file=LegionAudioTap15.mp3}} "I can't believe I have to call a meeting for this idiocy! Is everyone here? Where's [[Omega Sova|Sova]]? Never mind, forget him. What is wrong with all of you? I swear, [[Omega Phoenix|Phoenix]] must have burnt out your eyes because none of you have any damn vision! Can't you see? Our hands are around [[Sage|her]] neck, she's gasping for breath, all we have to do is squeeze! So I don't have time for your twenty questions, your hand wringing, your indecision, I don't care if you like me, you don't have to agree! All you have to do is your job! If you can't do that, then leave. Get in line or get out of my way! Meeting over."

